// Least labeled margin strictly above the smallest.
// No pair returns nothing. Equal margins return nothing.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE mnext ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG mnext rank

IMPULSE mnext 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "mnext" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
